and proceed to obtain a recursive estimate for $A_k$ and $B_k$. We first estimate $B_{k+1}$ in terms of $A_k$ and $B_k$. For this, we use the algorithm \eqref{NEAR DGD} along with \eqref{average} and  \eqref{11t} to find
